<Layout title="About" description="Free previous year papers and mock tests for government exam preparation." path="/about/">
  <section class="wrap sec"><div class="prose">
<h1>About Abhyas</h1>
<p>Abhyas is a free practice platform for government exam aspirants. It focuses on two things only: previous year papers and mock test series. There are no video courses and no paid plans.</p>
<h2>What you get</h2>
<ul><li>Timed tests with a question palette, review marking and negative marking.</li><li>Instant score, accuracy and subject-wise analysis with a solution for every question.</li><li>Hindi and English question view.</li><li>Progress, saved questions and history stored on your own device.</li></ul>
<h2>Please note</h2>
<p>Papers and tests here are for practice. Exam patterns and syllabi change, so always confirm the latest details in the official notification of the exam conducting body. Abhyas is independent and not affiliated with any exam conducting body.</p>
  </div></section>
</Layout>
